INSERT INTO public.question_versions VALUES ('eb0fba30-7875-4383-9e60-cbd43cf999b2', '584468ea-73fa-4634-bd9c-6f56323332ea', 1, 'Salt is soluble in water, but sand is insoluble in water. This difference allows a mixture of salt and sand to be separated using this apparatus. Step 2 Step 3', 10, 3, 900, NULL, 'SUGGESTED', '36b71b6c-5e35-532f-9a1c-6c6281badb30', 0.6, 'glm-ocr-qp-v1+glm-ocr-ms-v1', '2026-09-13 12:41:17.661057+00');
