dryness”for2marks\nIf filter/decant/pour off\nwater mark not scored,then\nmarks can be awarded as\nfollows:\nM1leave in warm\nplace/sun/on window ledge/\nheat or warm(in oven)\nM2to evaporate/remove\nwater/until dry\nNo marks can be awarded if\nthere is a statement about\nusing strong heating or a\nbunsen burner | 1\n1", "row_count": 1, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000043", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 43, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["(f)", "$NaNO_{2}M_{r}=69$", "Award mark if 138 seen", "1"], ["n(NaNO_{3}/NaNO_{2})=0.02OR", "ecf for incorrect M_{r}$", "1"], ["$\\frac{1.70\\times 69}{85}/\\frac{1.70\\times 138}{170}$", "", ""], ["1.38(g)", "Accept 2sf or betterCorrect answer with no working scores 3 marks", "1"]], "text": "(f) | $NaNO_{2}M_{r}=69$ | Award mark if 138 seen | 1\nn(NaNO_{3}/NaNO_{2})=0.02OR | ecf for incorrect M_{r}$ | 1\n$\\frac{1.70\\times 69}{85}/\\frac{1.70\\times 138}{170}$ |  | \n1.38(g) | Accept 2sf or betterCorrect answer with no working scores 3 marks | 1", "row_count": 4, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000044", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 44, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["11(a)", "breaking bonds absorbs energy/endothermic making bonds releases energy/exothermic more energy released than absorbed", "", "1"], ["Ignore ref to numbers of bonds“more energy released in making bonds than absorbed in breaking bonds” scores 3 marks", "1"], ["", "1"], ["(b)(i)", "(from) white(to) blueCuSO4+5H2O→CuSO4.5H2O", "Reject colourless", "1"], ["Ignore qualifiers such as pale/light/dark", "1"], ["Award M3 for CuSO4andCuSO4.5H2O", "1"], ["Award M4 for5H2ONo penalty for reversible arrowNo penalty for missing dotCorrect equation reversed=1markIgnore state symbolsIf neither M3 not M4 awarded,then award1mark for correctly balanced equation usingxorothernumber instead of5", "1"], ["(ii)(measure)boiling/freezing/melting point100℃/0℃", "Accept just heat/distil/boil/freeze the water", "1"], ["Value must match propertyAccept〇/Cin place of〇Cbutdo not awardM2if only value givenReject‘evaporates’by itself", "1"], ["(c)(i)red(ii)more than one colour in acid/indicatespH/shows strongly orweakly acidic/shows how acidicthe water is(iii)any value in range1-6.9", "Allow pink", "1"], ["Do not accept just more than one colour", "1"], ["1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n11(a) | breaking bonds absorbs energy/endothermic making bonds releases energy/exothermic more energy released than absorbed |  | 1\nIgnore ref to numbers of bonds“more energy released in making bonds than absorbed in breaking bonds” scores 3 marks | 1\n | 1\n(b)(i) | (from) white(to) blueCuSO4+5H2O→CuSO4.5H2O | Reject colourless | 1\nIgnore qualifiers such as pale/light/dark | 1\nAward M3 for CuSO4andCuSO4.5H2O | 1\nAward M4 for5H2ONo penalty for reversible arrowNo penalty for missing dotCorrect equation reversed=1markIgnore state symbolsIf neither M3 not M4 awarded,then award1mark for correctly balanced equation usingxorothernumber instead of5 | 1\n(ii)(measure)boiling/freezing/melting point100℃/0℃ | Accept just heat/distil/boil/freeze the water | 1\nValue must match propertyAccept〇/Cin place of〇Cbutdo not awardM2if only value givenReject‘evaporates’by itself | 1\n(c)(i)red(ii)more than one colour in acid/indicatespH/shows strongly orweakly acidic/shows how acidicthe water is(iii)any value in range1-6.9 | Allow pink | 1\nDo not accept just more than one colour | 1\n1", "row_count": 13, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000045", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 45, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "INTERNATIONAL GCSE CHEMISTRY 4CHO/1C - SUMMER 2011", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000022", "e000024", "e000026", "e000028", "e000034", "e000039", "e000046", "e000047", "e000048"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "187bfe95-7ac7-5e00-8521-66d359c34679", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T12:40:55.978833682Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 132, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 2, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "June 2011", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "International GCSE", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Chemistry (4CH0) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Science Double Award (4SC0) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel is one of the leading examining and awarding bodies in the UK and throughout the world. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Through a network of UK and overseas offices, Edexcel''s centres receive the support they need to help them deliver their education and training programmes to learners.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "For further information, please call our GCE line on 0844 576 0025, our GCSE team on 0844 576 0027, or visit our website at www.edexcel.com.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "If you have any subject specific questions about the content of this Examiners'' Report that require the help of a subject specialist, you may find our Ask The Expert email service helpful.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Ask The Expert can be accessed online at the following link: http://www.edexcel.com/Aboutus/contact-us/", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Alternatively, you can contact our Science Advisor directly by sending an email to Science specialist on Sciencesubjectadvisor@EdexcelExperts.co.uk. You can also telephone 0844 576 0037 to speak to a member of our subject advisor team.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "(If you are calling from outside the UK please dial + 44 1204 770 696 and state that you would like to speak to the Science subject specialist).", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All candidates must receive the same treatment. Examiners must mark the first candidate in exactly the same way as they mark the last.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Mark schemes should be applied positively. Candidates must be rewarded for what they have shown they can do rather than penalised for omissions.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Examiners should mark according to the mark scheme not according to their perception of where the grade boundaries may lie.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "There is no ceiling on achievement. All marks on the mark scheme should be used appropriately.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All the marks on the mark scheme are designed to be awarded. Examiners should always award full marks if deserved, i.e. if the answer matches the mark scheme. Examiners should also be prepared to award zero marks if the candidate''s response is not worthy of credit according to the mark scheme.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Where some judgement is required, mark schemes will provide the principles by which marks will be awarded and exemplification may be limited.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "When examiners are in doubt regarding the application of the mark scheme to a candidate''s response, the team leader must be consulted.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000018", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 18, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Crossed out work should be marked UNLESS the candidate has replaced it with an alternative response.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "INTERNATIONAL GCSE CHEMISTRY 4CHO/1C - SUMMER 2011", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000020", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 20, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 8 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000022", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 22, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 6 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000024", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 24, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 6 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000026", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 26, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 6 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000028", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 28, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 9 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000034", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 34, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Total 18 marks", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000039", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 39, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Further copies of this publication are available from International Regional Offices at www.edexcel.com/international", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000046", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 46, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "For more information on Edexcel qualifications, please visit www.edexcel.com", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000047", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 47, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Alternatively, you can contact Customer Services at www.edexcel.com/ask or on + 44 1204 770 696", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000048", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 48, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 12:41:17.169439+00');
