swer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["10(c)", "Increased (rate)", "Accept alternatives such as faster reactions", "1"], ["Increased (rate)", "Accept alternatives such as faster reactions\nIgnore references to equilibrium/yield\nIgnore references to forward and reverse reactions", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n10(c) | Increased (rate) | Accept alternatives such as faster reactions | 1\nIncreased (rate) | Accept alternatives such as faster reactions\nIgnore references to equilibrium/yield\nIgnore references to forward and reverse reactions | 1", "row_count": 3, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000043", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 43, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["10 d iii", "$M_{r}(\\mathrm{NH}_{4}\\mathrm{NO}_{3})=80$n(=40000)=500(mol)80", "Award M1 for 80 anywhereECF from incorrect $M_{r}$500 scores M1 and M20.5(mol) scores only M1", "11"], ["Answer to di/500(mol)", "", "1"], ["$M_{r}(\\mathrm{NH}_{3})=17$m=$\\frac{500\\times17}{1000}=8.5$(kg)1000", "Award M1 for 17 anywhere, except if result of incorrect calculationECF from incorrect $M_{r}$Moles CQ on iiAccept answer in g if unit is givenIf no conversion from kg to g in i,and no conversion from g to kg in iii,penalise these errors once onlyAward 2 marks for 8.5(kg)", "11"], ["10 e", "phosphorus AND potassium", "Accept in either orderIgnore symbolsReject phosphate/phosphine", "1"], ["", "", "Total", "13"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n10 d iii | $M_{r}(\\mathrm{NH}_{4}\\mathrm{NO}_{3})=80$n(=40000)=500(mol)80 | Award M1 for 80 anywhereECF from incorrect $M_{r}$500 scores M1 and M20.5(mol) scores only M1 | 11\nAnswer to di/500(mol) |  | 1\n$M_{r}(\\mathrm{NH}_{3})=17$m=$\\frac{500\\times17}{1000}=8.5$(kg)1000 | Award M1 for 17 anywhere, except if result of incorrect calculationECF from incorrect $M_{r}$Moles CQ on iiAccept answer in g if unit is givenIf no conversion from kg to g in i,and no conversion from g to kg in iii,penalise these errors once onlyAward 2 marks for 8.5(kg) | 11\n10 e | phosphorus AND potassium | Accept in either orderIgnore symbolsReject phosphate/phosphine | 1\n |  | Total | 13", "row_count": 6, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000044", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 44, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["11 a i", "delocalised electrons / sea of electrons\nmove / flow (through structure) / mobile (when voltage/potential difference applied)", "Ignore free electrons\nM2 needs mention of electrons, e.g. \"electrons move/flow\" scores\nM2 but not M1\nIgnore references to carrying charge/current\nNo penalty for references to aluminium atoms or ions / nuclei / protons, but any mention of these moving = 0/2", "1"], ["ii", "layers/sheets/planes/rows AND\n(positive)\nions/atoms/particles", "Reject molecules/protons/electrons/nuclei", "1"], ["", "slide (over each other)", "Allow\nslip/flow/shift/roll/move/OWTTE in place of slide\nDo not award M2 if no mention of layers or equivalent\nDo not award M2 if protons/electrons/nuclei", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n11 a i | delocalised electrons / sea of electrons\nmove / flow (through structure) / mobile (when voltage/potential difference applied) | Ignore free electrons\nM2 needs mention of electrons, e.g. \"electrons move/flow\" scores\nM2 but not M1\nIgnore references to carrying charge/current\nNo penalty for references to aluminium atoms or ions / nuclei / protons, but any mention of these moving = 0/2 | 1\nii | layers/sheets/planes/rows AND\n(positive)\nions/atoms/particles | Reject molecules/protons/electrons/nuclei | 1\n | slide (over each other) | Allow\nslip/flow/shift/roll/move/OWTTE in place of slide\nDo not award M2 if no mention of layers or equivalent\nDo not award M2 if protons/electrons/nuclei | 1", "row_count": 4, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000045", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 45, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["11 b", "NITROGEN(simple) molecular structure", "Accept(nitrogen/N2/small/discrete) molecules", "1"], ["intermolecular forces(of attraction)/forces between molecules", "Accept intermolecular bondsReference to intermolecular also scores M1", "1"], ["weak/easily overcome/need little energy to overcome", "If any reference to breaking covalent bonds or any other type of bonding, only M1 can be awarded", "1"], ["SILICA giant(structure)", "Accept macromolecularIgnore lattice", "1"], ["covalent(bonds)", "Covalent can be anywhere in answer", "1"], ["bonds strong/hard to break/need a lot of energy to break", "If any reference to breaking intermolecular forces or any other type of bonding, only M4 can be awardedAny five for 1 mark each", "1"], ["", "Total", "9"], ["", "Total for paper", "120"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n11 b | NITROGEN(simple) molecular structure | Accept(nitrogen/N2/small/discrete) molecules | 1\nintermolecular forces(of attraction)/forces between molecules | Accept intermolecular bondsReference to intermolecular also scores M1 | 1\nweak/easily overcome/need little energy to overcome | If any reference to breaking covalent bonds or any other type of bonding, only M1 can be awarded | 1\nSILICA giant(structure) | Accept macromolecularIgnore lattice | 1\ncovalent(bonds) | Covalent can be anywhere in answer | 1\nbonds strong/hard to break/need a lot of energy to break | If any reference to breaking intermolecular forces or any other type of bonding, only M4 can be awardedAny five for 1 mark each | 1\n | Total | 9\n | Total for paper | 120", "row_count": 9, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000046", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 46, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000011", "e000012", "e000013", "e000014", "e000015", "e000016", "e000017", "e000047", "e000048", "e000049", "e000050", "e000051", "e000052", "e000053"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "78d61e9f-767a-5e86-b1a0-e92f53f3f814", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T12:52:04.859934925Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 240, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 1, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2013", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "International GCSE", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Chemistry (4CH0) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Science Double Award (4SC0)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel Level 1/Level 2 Certificate", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Chemistry (KCH0) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Science (Double Award) (KSC0)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC qualifications come from Pearson, the world''s leading learning company. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers. For further information visit our qualifications websites at www.edexcel.com or www.btec.co.uk for our BTEC qualifications.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Alternatively, you can get in touch with us using the details on our contact us page at www.edexcel.com/contactus.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "If you have any subject specific questions about this specification that require the help of a subject specialist, you can speak directly to the subject team at Pearson. Their contact details can be found on this link: www.edexcel.com/teachingservices.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "You can also use our online Ask the Expert service at www.edexcel.com/ask. You will need an Edexcel username and password to access this service.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Our aim is to help everyone progress in their lives through education. We believe in every kind of learning, for all kinds of people, wherever they are in the world. We''ve been involved in education for over 150 years, and by working across 70 countries, in 100 languages, we have built an international reputation for our commitment to high standards and raising achievement through innovation in education. Find out more about how we can help you and your students at: www.pearson.com/uk", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2013 Publications Code UG037094 All the material in this publication is copyright $ \\textcircled{c} $ Pearson Education Ltd 2013", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Further copies of this publication are available from Edexcel Publications, Adamsway, Mansfield, Notts, NG18 4FN", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000047", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 47, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Telephone 01623 467467", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000048", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 48, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Fax 01623 450481", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000049", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 49, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Email publication.orders@edexcel.com", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000050", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 50, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Order Code UG037094 Summer 2013", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000051", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 51, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "For more information on Edexcel qualifications, please visit our website www.edexcel.com", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000052", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 52, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Education Limited. Registered company number 872828 with its registered office at Edinburgh Gate, Harlow, Essex CM20 2JE", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000053", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 53, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 12:52:25.312082+00');
