lfateturns blueORanhydrous/blue cobalt chlorideturns pink", "Ignore colourlessAccept correct formulaIncorrect formula(eg CuSO) counts as near missAccept correct formulaIncorrect formula(eg CoCl) counts as near missM2 DEP on M1 or near miss", "2"], ["ii", "measure boiling point / freezing point", "Accept boil it / freeze itIgnore heat", "2"], ["", "100(℃)/0(℃)", "Value must match propertyIgnore units", ""], ["", "", "Answers such as boils/distils at 100℃/freezes at 0℃ score M2 only", ""]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n3 a | burns with a pop/squeakORuse burning/lit splint/flame to see if pop/squeak | Must be reference to test and resultReference to splint/match with no indication of flame is not enoughIgnore flame extinguishedReject reference to glowing splintSqueaky pop test on its own is not enough | 1\nb i | anhydrous/white copper sulfateturns blueORanhydrous/blue cobalt chlorideturns pink | Ignore colourlessAccept correct formulaIncorrect formula(eg CuSO) counts as near missAccept correct formulaIncorrect formula(eg CoCl) counts as near missM2 DEP on M1 or near miss | 2\nii | measure boiling point / freezing point | Accept boil it / freeze itIgnore heat | 2\n | 100(℃)/0(℃) | Value must match propertyIgnore units | \n |  | Answers such as boils/distils at 100℃/freezes at 0℃ score M2 only | ", "row_count": 6, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000022", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 22, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["3 b iii", "cross by carbon dioxide from the air reacts to cause the cloudiness cross by the cloudiness is caused by the formation of a white precipitate\n□ carbon dioxide forms when the hydrogen burns\n□ carbon dioxide from the air reacts to cause the cloudiness\n□ the cloudiness is caused by the formation of calcium hydroxide\n□ the cloudiness is caused by the formation of a white precipitate\n□ the reaction in the limewater is an example of oxidation", "If 3 boxes crossed then max 1\nIf 4 or more boxes crossed then 0", "2"], ["", "Total 7 marks"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n3 b iii | cross by carbon dioxide from the air reacts to cause the cloudiness cross by the cloudiness is caused by the formation of a white precipitate\n□ carbon dioxide forms when the hydrogen burns\n□ carbon dioxide from the air reacts to cause the cloudiness\n□ the cloudiness is caused by the formation of calcium hydroxide\n□ the cloudiness is caused by the formation of a white precipitate\n□ the reaction in the limewater is an example of oxidation | If 3 boxes crossed then max 1\nIf 4 or more boxes crossed then 0 | 2\n | Total 7 marks", "row_count": 3, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000023", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 23, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["4 a i", "reactants labelled wrong way round/OWTTE", "Accept manganese(IV) oxide is the solid OR hydrogen peroxide is the liquid\nIgnore just manganese(IV) oxide/hydrogen peroxide is wrongly labelled", "1"], ["ii", "bung/cork", "Accept stopper\nIgnore plug", "1"], ["iii", "to prevent oxygen/gas from escaping\n(without a bung), oxygen/gas would escape/could not be collected", "Do not penalise wrong gas, such as hydrogen", "1"], ["b", "use a (gas) syringe", "Accept collect in gas jar by displacement of air in place of syringe", "1"], ["c", "2 2 (1)", "Accept multiples and fractions", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n4 a i | reactants labelled wrong way round/OWTTE | Accept manganese(IV) oxide is the solid OR hydrogen peroxide is the liquid\nIgnore just manganese(IV) oxide/hydrogen peroxide is wrongly labelled | 1\nii | bung/cork | Accept stopper\nIgnore plug | 1\niii | to preve