engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["12 g", "more particles(in a given volume)", "Accept ions\nReject atoms/molecules\nAccept quantitative answer such as twice as many particles when concentration doubles", "1"], ["more collisions(between particles)/OWTTE", "", "1"], ["per unit time/OWTTE", "more frequent collisions scores M2 and M3\nIgnore greater chance/likelihood of collisions\nAccept reverse argument if clear that decreasing concentration is being considered\nMAX 1 if any reference to particles moving faster/having more energy", "1"], ["", "Total 15 marks"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n12 g | more particles(in a given volume) | Accept ions\nReject atoms/molecules\nAccept quantitative answer such as twice as many particles when concentration doubles | 1\nmore collisions(between particles)/OWTTE |  | 1\nper unit time/OWTTE | more frequent collisions scores M2 and M3\nIgnore greater chance/likelihood of collisions\nAccept reverse argument if clear that decreasing concentration is being considered\nMAX 1 if any reference to particles moving faster/having more energy | 1\n | Total 15 marks", "row_count": 5, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000041", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 41, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000005", "e000006", "e000007"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "sectionId": "s002", "elementIds": ["e000009", "e000010"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "General Marking Guidance", "sectionId": "s003", "elementIds": ["e000012", "e000013", "e000014", "e000015", "e000016", "e000017", "e000018", "e000019"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "a3b81b79-2fa4-5561-b55d-a609c2b5aada", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T12:52:49.833320159Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 159, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 1, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "January 2015", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel International GCSE in Chemistry (4CHO) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel Certificate in Chemistry (KCH0) Paper 1C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC qualifications come from Pearson, the world''s leading learning company. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers. For further information, please visit our website at www.edexcel.com.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Our website subject pages hold useful resources, support material and live feeds from our subject advisors giving you access to a portal of information. If you have any subject specific questions about this specification that require the help of a subject specialist, you may find our Ask The Expert email service helpful.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "www.edexcel.com/contactus", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson aspires to be the world''s leading learning company. Our aim is to help everyone progress in their lives through education. We believe in every kind of learning, for all kinds of people, wherever they are in the world. We''ve been involved in education for over 150 years, and by working across 70 countries, in 100 languages, we have built an international reputation for our commitment to high standards and raising achievement through innovation in education. Find out more about how we can help you and your students at: www.pearson.com/uk", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "January 2015 Publications Code UG040479 All the material in this publication is copyright $ \\textcircled{c} $ Pearson Education Ltd 2015", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "General Marking Guidance", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All candidates must receive the same treatment. Examiners must mark the first candidate in exactly the same way as they mark the last.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Mark schemes should be applied positively. Candidates must be rewarded for what they have shown they can do rather than penalised for omissions.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Examiners should mark according to the mark scheme not according to their perception of where the grade boundaries may lie.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "There is no ceiling on achievement. All marks on the mark scheme should be used appropriately.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All the marks on the mark scheme are designed to be awarded. Examiners should always award full marks if deserved, i.e. if the answer matches the mark scheme. Examiners should also be prepared to award zero marks if the candidate''s response is not worthy of credit according to the mark scheme.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Where some judgement is required, mark schemes will provide the principles by which marks will be awarded and exemplification may be limited.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "When examiners are in doubt regarding the application of the mark scheme to a candidate''s response, the team leader must be consulted.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000018", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 18, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Crossed out work should be marked UNLESS the candidate has replaced it with an alternative response.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 12:53:11.281494+00');
