, "Penalise incorrect use of case, superscripts etc.", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n3(a)(i)(ii) | fractional distillation | ALLOW fractionation/fractionatingREJECT distillation on its own | 1\nkerosene - fuel for aircraft/heaters/lampsbitumen - roads/roofing | ALLOW paraffin heaters/lamps | 2\n3(b)(i)(ii)(iii) | M1 alkanesM2(because)C20H42fits general formula of alkanes/CnH2n+2 | ALLOW contains no double bonds/has only single bonds/saturated hydrocarbonIGNORE reference to name ending | 2\nsilica or alumina | ACCEPT silicon dioxide/aluminium oxide/alumino-silicates/zeolitesACCEPT correct formulae i.e.SiO2/Al2O3 | 1\nC20H42→3C4H8+C8H18 | Penalise incorrect use of case, superscripts etc. | 1", "row_count": 6, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000023", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 23, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["(c)(i)", "M1 consists of hydrogen/H and carbon/C (atoms)", "REJECT hydrogen and carbon molecules", "2"], ["M2 only", "REJECT atom/mixture containing H and C", ""], ["Contains only (carbon-carbon) single bonds", "M2 dep on hydrogen and carbon in M1", ""], ["(ii)", "M1 bromine (water)", "ALLOW does not contain double/multiple bonds", "1"], ["M2 with unsaturated goes colourless/decolourises", "ACCEPT use of KMnO4", "3"], ["M3 with saturated no change/stays orange", "IGNORE clear/discoloured If initial colour stated must be correct. ACCEPT any combination of brown/orange/yellow ACCEPT any combination of brown/orange/yellow", ""], ["(d)(i)", "but-1-ene", "ACCEPT 1-butene ALLOW 1-butylene", "1"], ["OR", "ALLOW cyclobutane ALLOW methyl cyclopropane", "1"], ["OR", "", ""]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n(c)(i) | M1 consists of hydrogen/H and carbon/C (atoms) | REJECT hydrogen and carbon molecules | 2\nM2 only | REJECT atom/mixture containing H and C | \nContains only (carbon-carbon) single bonds | M2 dep on hydrogen and carbon in M1 | \n(ii) | M1 bromine (water) | ALLOW does not contain double/multiple bonds | 1\nM2 with unsaturated goes colourless/decolourises | ACCEPT use of KMnO4 | 3\nM3 with saturated no change/stays orange | IGNORE clear/discoloured If initial colour stated must be correct. ACCEPT any combination of brown/orange/yellow ACCEPT any combination of brown/orange/yellow | \n(d)(i) | but-1-ene | ACCEPT 1-butene ALLOW 1-butylene | 1\nOR | ALLOW cyclobutane ALLOW methyl cyclopropane | 1\nOR |  | ", "row_count": 10, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000024", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 24, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["4", "(a)(i)", "M1(electrostatic) attraction between bonding/shared pair of electrons andM2(both) nuclei of atoms(in the bond)OR", "No M2 if reference to just one nucleus", "2"], ["M1 bonding/shared pair of electronsM2 attracted to(both) nuclei of atoms(in the bond)", "No M2 if reference to just one nucleus"], ["(ii)M1 two shared pairs of electrons between two carbon atomsM2 rest of molecule correct", "ALLOW any combination of dots and crosses.", "2"], ["M2 dep on M1"], ["(b)(i)Clip together", "(i)Clip together", "M1 intermolecular forces(of attraction)/(attractive) forces between molecules are weak", "ALLOW weak intermolecular bonds/weak bonds between molecules", "2"], ["M2 little(heat/thermal)energy required to overcome these forces", "IGNORE less energy"], ["ALLOW bonds for forces if intermolecular mentioned or implied in M1"], ["(ii)Clip together", "(ii)Clip together", "(in B) stronger forces(of attraction)(between molecules than in A)", "0 marks if implied that covalent bonds break", "1"], ["ALLOW bonds for forces if intermolecular mentioned in(i)"], ["ALLOW molecules of B are larger than those of A"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n4 | (a)(i) | M1(electrostatic) attraction between bonding/shared pair of electrons andM2(both) nuclei of atoms(in the bond)OR | No M2 if reference to just one nucleus | 2\nM1 bonding/shared pair of electronsM2 attracted to(both) nuclei of atoms(in the bond) | No M2 if reference to just one nucleus\n(ii)M1 two shared pairs of electrons between two carbon atomsM2 rest of molecule correct | ALLOW any combination of dots and crosses. | 2\nM2 dep on M1\n(b)(i)Clip together | (i)Clip together | M1 intermolecular forces(of attraction)/(attractive) forces between molecules are weak | ALLOW weak intermolecular bonds/weak bonds between molecules | 2\nM2 little(heat/thermal)energy required to overcome these forces | IGNORE less energy\nALLOW bonds for forces if intermolecular mentioned or implied in M1\n(ii)Clip together | (ii)Clip together | (in B) stronger forces(of attraction)(between molecules than in A) | 0 marks if implied that covalent bonds break | 1\nALLOW bonds for forces if intermolecular mentioned in(i)\nALLOW molecules of B are larger than those of A", "row_count": 11, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000026", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 26, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["(iii)", "M1 58/[(2x12)+(5x1)] or 58/29(=2)\nM2 C4H10\nCorrect answer alone scores 2 marks", "2"], ["(c)", "M1 giant(covalent structure)\nEITHER\nM2 many/strong(covalent) bonds need to be broken\nOR\nM3 large amount of(heat/thermal) energy needed to break the bonds", "2"], ["", "", ""]], "text": "(iii) | M1 58/[(2x12)+(5x1)] or 58/29(=2)\nM2 C4H10\nCorrect answer alone scores 2 marks | 2\n(c) | M1 giant(covalent structure)\nEITHER\nM2 many/strong(covalent) bonds need to be broken\nOR\nM3 large amount of(heat/thermal) energy needed to break the bonds | 2\n |  | ", "row_count": 3, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000027", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 3, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 27, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["5(a)", "(burns with a) blue flame", "", "1"], ["(b)", "2HCl+Na2SO3→2NaCl+SO2+H2O\nM1 all correct formulae\nM2 balancing correct", "ACCEPT multiples or fractions\nIGNORE state symbols even if incorrect\nM2 dep on M1", "2"], ["(c)(i)", "to dry the gas", "ACCEPT to remove/absorb water", "1"], ["(ii)", "downward delivery", "ACCEPT upward displacement of air\nALLOW downwards collection", "1"], ["(iii)", "denser than air", "IGNORE heavier than air/ denser than oxygen", "1"], ["(d)(i)", "sulfurous(acid)/H2SO3", "ALLOW sulfuric acid/H2SO4\nif name and formula given both must be correct", "1"], ["(ii)", "red/pink", "", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n5(a) | (burns with a) blue flame |  | 1\n(b) | 2HCl+Na2SO3→2NaCl+SO2+H2O\nM1 all correct formulae\nM2 balancing correct | ACCEPT multiples or fractions\nIGNORE state symbols even if incorrect\nM2 dep on M1 | 2\n(c)(i) | to dry the gas | ACCEPT to remove/absorb water | 1\n(ii) | downward delivery | ACCEPT upward displacement of air\nALLOW downwards collection | 1\n(iii) | denser than air | IGNORE heavier than air/ denser than oxygen | 1\n(d)(i) | sulfurous(acid)/H2SO3 | ALLOW sulfuric acid/H2SO4\nif name and formula given both must be correct | 1\n(ii) | red/pink |  | 1", "row_count": 8, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000029", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 29, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["(iii)", "H+", "ACCEPT H3O+", "1"], ["(iv)", "orange", "ALLOW yellow", "1"], ["", "", "", ""]], "text": "(iii) | H+ | ACCEPT H3O+ | 1\n(iv) | orange | ALLOW yellow | 1\n |  |  | ", "row_count": 3, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000030", "page_number": 1,