i) | M1 add anhydrous copper sulfate | ALLOW add white copper sulfate | 2\nM2 turns(from white) to blue | M2 dep on copper sulfate in M1 | \nALLOW | \nM1 add anhydrous/blue cobalt chloride | \nM2 turns(from blue) to pink | \nM2 dep on cobalt chloride in M1 | \n(ii) | M1 measure the boiling point/freezing point | ALLOW boil it or freeze it | 2\nM2 100℃/0℃ | Value must match property | \n(b) | M1 mass of hydrated zinc sulfate=54.46-41.64OR12.82g |  | 5\nM2 Moles of hydrated zinc sulfate=12.82÷287OR0.0447 | ALLOW M1÷287 | \nM3 Moles H2O=0.0447×7OR0.313 | ALLOW M2×7 | \nM4 Mass H2O=5.63g | ALLOW M3×18 | \nM5 Volume H2O5.6cm3 | Must be 1dp | \nALLOW M4 to 1dp | \n(c)(i) | 1.7 | ALLOW 2 or more significant figuresREJECT incorrect rounding | 1\nM1 stand the measuring cylinder in a beaker of iceOR | ALLOW any way of cooling the measuring | 2", "row_count": 17, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000039", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 39, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["", "M1 replace the delivery tube with a (Liebig) condenserM2 less water/water vapour/steam lost", "cylinder or delivery tubeALLOW add a condenserIGNORE add a stopper/bungALLOW more water(vapour)/steam condensesALLOW less waterevaporates", ""], ["Total for question=12"]], "text": " | M1 replace the delivery tube with a (Liebig) condenserM2 less water/water vapour/steam lost | cylinder or delivery tubeALLOW add a condenserIGNORE add a stopper/bungALLOW more water(vapour)/steam condensesALLOW less waterevaporates | \nTotal for question=12", "row_count": 2, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000040", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 40, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", 