 Reject | Marks\n2 | pH at start | pH at end | Correct letter |  |  | 1\n7 | 7 | A | 1\n7 | 11 | E | 1\n14 | 7 | C | 1\n7 | 6 | B | 1\n |  |  | Total | 4", "row_count": 7, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 5, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Accept", "Reject", "Marks"], ["3(a)", "Highest temperature", "Temperature rise", "", "Readings to 1dp only if zero", "", "2"], ["28", "3"], ["30", "6"], ["32", "9"], ["32", "9"], ["(b)(i)", "M1&M2- all points correctly plotted to the nearest gridline[Deduct 1 mark for each incorrectly plotted point up to a max.of 2]M3- straight lines drawn through points 1 to 3 and through points 3 to 5line does not need to be extrapolated to(0,0)must be drawn with the aid of a ruler", "", "", "2"], ["(ii)", "0.75(g)", "correct reading to nearest gridline from candidate''s graph", "incorrect unit", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Accept | Reject | Marks\n3(a) | Highest temperature | Temperature rise |  | Readings to 1dp only if zero |  | 2\n28 | 3\n30 | 6\n32 | 9\n32 | 9\n(b)(i) | M1&M2- all points correctly plotted to the nearest gridline[Deduct 1 mark for each incorrectly plotted point up to a max.of 2]M3- straight lines drawn through points 1 to 3 and through points 3 to 5line does not need to be extrapolated to(0,0)must be drawn with the aid of a ruler |  |  | 2\n(ii) | 0.75(g) | correct reading to nearest gridline from candidate''s graph | incorrect unit | 1", "row_count": 8, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 5, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Accept", "Reject", "Marks"], ["3(c)", "copper sulfate/copper ions completely reacted/been used up/run out\nIGN