, "", "", "", "", ""], ["3", "a", "i", "", "tungsten(VI) oxide / tungsten trioxide", "Accept tungsten oxide\nReject tungsten oxide with other oxidation numbers or prefixes such as mono- and di-", "1"], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "ii", "", "(1) 3 (1) 3", "Accept multiples and fractions", "1"], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "iii", "", "loss of oxygen (by it / tungsten / tungsten oxide)", "Accept decrease in oxidation number of tungsten\nAccept tungsten ions gain electrons", "1"], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "b", "", "M1", "Ca\n13.9\n40\nOR\n0.348", "W\n63.9\n184", "O\n22.2\n16", "Apply ECF\n0/3 for use of any atomic numbers / division wrong way round / multiplication\nIf division by 32 instead of 16 for O, then no M1, but M2 and M3 can score by ECF(CaWO2)\nIf any transcription error (eg 69.3 in place of 63.9), then no M1, but M2 and M3 can score by ECF", "1"], ["", "", "", "M2", "0.348\n0.347\nOR\n1:1:4", "0.347\n0.347", "1.39\n0.347", "", "1"], ["", "", "", "M3", "CaWO4", "Accept elements in any order\nCorrect final answer scores 3", "1"]], "text": "Question number |  | Answer | Notes | Marks\n |  |  |  |  |  | \n3 | a | i |  | tungsten(VI) oxide / tungsten trioxide | Accept tungsten oxide\nReject tungsten oxide with other oxidation numbers or prefixes such as mono- and di- | 1\n |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  | ii |  | (1) 3 (1) 3 | Accept multiples and fractions | 1\n |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  | iii |  | loss of oxygen (by it / tungsten / tungsten oxide) | Accept decrease in oxidation number of tungsten\nAccept tungsten ions gain electrons | 1\n |  |  |  |  |  | \n | b |  | M1 | Ca\n13.9\n40\nOR\n0.348 | W\n63.9\n184 | O\n22.2\n16 | Apply ECF\n0/3 for use of any atomic numbers / division wrong way round / multiplication\nIf division by 32 instead of 16 for O, then no M1, but M2 and M3 can score by ECF(CaWO2)\nIf any transcription error (eg 69.3 in place of 63.9), then no M1, but M2 and M3 can score by ECF | 1\n |  |  | M2 | 0.348\n0.347\nOR\n1:1:4 | 0.347\n0.347 | 1.39\n0.347 |  | 1\n |  |  | M3 | CaWO4 | Accept elements in any order\nCorrect final answer scores 3 | 1", "row_count": 11, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 5, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["3", "c", "i", "M1", "59.6×184/298", "Award 1 for n(WF6)=0.2mol and any sight of0.2", "1"], ["", "", "", "M2", "36.8(g)", "No ECF from incorrect expression except for transcription error-eg using289 instead of298ECF from incorrect number of moles", "1"], ["", "", "", "", "", "Award 2 for correct final answer", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["", "", "ii", "M1", "47.5×100/52.0", "", "1"], ["", "", "", "M2", "91.3(%)", "Accept any answer in range91-91.4Do not penalise excessive numbers of dp", "1"], ["", "", "", "", "", "Award 2 for correct final answer", ""], ["", "", "", "", "", "", ""], ["TOTAL", "", "", "", "14"]], "text": "Question number |  | Answer | Notes | Marks\n |  |  |  |  |  | \n3 | c | i | M1 | 59.6×184/298 | Award 1 for n(WF6)=0.2mol and any sight of0.2 | 1\n |  |  | M2 | 36.8(g) | No ECF from incorrect expression except for transcription error-eg using289 instead of298ECF from incorrect number of moles | 1\n |  |  |  |  | Award 2 for correct final answer | \n |  |  |  |  |  | \n |  | ii | M1 | 47.5×100/52.0 |  | 1\n |  |  | M2 | 91.3(%) | Accept any answer in range91-91.4Do not penalise excessive numbers of dp | 1\n |  |  |  |  | Award 2 for correct final answer | \n |  |  |  |  |  | \nTOTAL |  |  |  | 14", "row_count": 11, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000020", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 5, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 20, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"