Volume of Na2S2O3solution in cm3 | Volume of waterin cm3 | Timein seconds\n1 | 50 | 0 | 45\n2 | 40 | 10 | 60\n3 | 30 | 20 | 80\n4 | 20 | 30 | 130\n5 | 15 | 35 | 180\n6 | 10 | 40 | 255", "row_count": 7, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000067", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 67, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Test", "Observation"], ["add sodium hydroxide solution", ""], ["then heat the mixture and test the gas given off with damp red litmus paper", "litmus paper turns blue"], ["add dilute hydrochloric acid, then add a few drops of barium chloride solution", "white precipitate forms"]], "text": "Test | Observation\nadd sodium hydroxide solution | \nthen heat the mixture and test the gas given off with damp red litmus paper | litmus paper turns blue\nadd dilute hydrochloric acid, then add a few drops of barium chloride solution | white precipitate forms", "row_count": 4, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000096", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 2, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 96, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Process", "Explanation"], ["batch process", "the fermentation of sugars with yeast"], ["continuous process", "the hydration of ethene (produced from crude oil) with steam"]], "text": "Process | Explanation\nbatch process | the fermentation of sugars with yeast\ncontinuous process | the hydration of ethene (produced from crude oil) with steam", "row_count": 3, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000115", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 2, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 115, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["volume of carbon dioxide =", "dm3"]], "text": "volume of carbon dioxide = | dm3", "row_count": 1, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000126", "page_number": 1, "boun