ery incorrect point. | 2\n1\n(ii) | M3 two straight lines of best fit which must meet at3cmand6cm3 |  | \n(iii) | Anyone from:the precipitate wasn''t left to settle(for long enough)the tube was on a slantnot enough/less than3.0cm3of silver nitrate added | ALLOW measured the height too earlyIGNORE references to human error unqualified | \n(iv) | all the copper[(II)]chloride has reacted | ALLOWthe silver nitrate is in excess/not all the silver nitrate has reacted | 1", "row_count": 10, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000028", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 28, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["(c)(i)", "Any one from:burette", "ALLOW measuring cylinder", "1"], ["(volumetric) pipette", "REJECT beaker", ""], ["(ii)", "Example calculation", "", "3"], ["M1 moles of coper chloride=(25x0.50)÷1000 OR0.0125 moles", "", ""], ["M2 moles of silver chloride=0.0250", "ALLOW answer to M1x2", ""], ["M3 mass of silver chloride=3.59g", "ALLOW answer to M1or M2x143.5ALLOW2or more significant figuresCorrect answer of 3.59g scores3 marks", ""], ["(iii)", "M1(0.744÷0.850)x100", "", "2"], ["M287.5(%)", "ALLOW2or more significant figures", ""], ["15 marks"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n(c)(i) | Any one from:burette | ALLOW measuring cylinder | 1\n(volumetric) pipette | REJECT beaker | \n(ii) | Example calculation |  | 3\nM1 moles of coper chloride=(25x0.50)÷1000 OR0.0125 moles |  | \nM2 moles of silver chloride=0.0250 | ALLOW answer to M1x2 | \nM3 mass of silver chloride=3.59g | ALLOW answer to M1or M2x143.5ALLOW2or more significant figuresCorrect answer of 3.59g scores3 marks | \n(iii) | M1(0.744÷0.850)x100 |  | 2\nM287.5(%) | ALLOW2or more significant figures | \n15 marks", "row_count": 10, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000029", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 29, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["7(a)", "M1 crude oil is heated/vapourised", "ALLOW boiled", "4"], ["M2 vapours/gases/compounds/hydrocarbons rise up the column", "ALLOW temperature gradient of the column", ""], ["M3 the column is hotter at the bottom than the top", "ALLOW vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons/condense at different heights", ""], ["M4 vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons condense at their boiling point", "ALLOW the vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons/fractions have different boiling points.", ""], ["(b)", "M1 temperature of 600℃-700℃", "", "2"], ["M2 catalyst of silica/alumina", "ALLOW aluminosilicates/zeolites/silicon dioxide/aluminium oxide", ""], ["", "IGNORE references to pressure", ""]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n7(a) | M1 crude oil is heated/vapourised | ALLOW boiled | 4\nM2 vapours/gases/compounds/hydrocarbons rise up the column | ALLOW temperature gradient of the column | \nM3 the column is hotter at the bottom than the top | ALLOW vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons/condense at different heights | \nM4 vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons condense at their boiling point | ALLOW the vapours/compounds/hydrocarbons/fractions have different boiling points. | \n(b) | M1 temperature of 600℃-700℃ |  | 2\nM2 catalyst of silica/alumina | ALLOW aluminosilicates/zeolites/silicon dioxide/aluminium oxide | \n | IGNORE references to pressure | ", "row_count": 8, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000030", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 30, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["(c)(i)", "M1 nitrogen(from the air) reacts/combines with oxygen(from the air)", "REJECT any implication that oxygen or nitrogen come from the fuel.", "2"], ["M2 at high temperatures(in the car engine)", "1"], ["(ii)", "Any one from:acid rainrespiratory problems", "Division by 4 can happen in M1,M2,M3 or M5ALLOW M1÷4M3(51500÷24000)=2.15 molesALLOW M2 orM1÷24000M4Mrof carbon dioxide is44M5 mass of carbon dioxide per Km=94.4gALLOW 94-95gALLOW ecf from incorrectMrCorrect answer of 94-95g scores 5 marks.", "5"], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", ""], ["", "", ""], ["14 marks"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n(c)(i) | M1 nitrogen(from the air) reacts/combines with oxygen(from the air) | REJECT any implication that oxygen or nitrogen come from the fuel. | 2\nM2 at high temperatures(in the car engine) | 1\n(ii) | Any one from:acid rainrespiratory problems | Division by 4 can happen in M1,M2,M3 or M5ALLOW M1÷4M3(51500÷24000)=2.15 molesALLOW M2 orM1÷24000M4Mrof carbon dioxide is44M5 mass of carbon dioxide per Km=94.4gALLOW 94-95gALLOW ecf from incorrectMrCorrect answer of 94-95g scores 5 marks. | 5\n | \n | \n | \n |  | \n14 marks", "row_count": 9, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000031", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 31, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000006"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "sectionId": "s002", "elementIds": ["e000008", "e000009", "e000010", "e000011", "e000012"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "General Marking Guidance", "sectionId": "s003", "elementIds": ["e000014", "e000015", "e000016", "e000017", "e000018", "e000019", "e000020", "e000021"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "097880a5-978f-55ab-82db-0f375f430b4d", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T13:01:06.698999659Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 49, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 1, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "PMT", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "January 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel International GCSE In Chemistry (4CH1) Paper 2C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC qualifications are awarded by Pearson, the UK''s largest awarding body. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers. For further information visit our qualifications websites at www.edexcel.com or www.btec.co.uk. Alternatively, you can get in touch with us using the details on our contact us page at www.edexcel.com/contactus.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson aspires to be the world''s leading learning company. Our aim is to help everyone progress in their lives through education. We believe in every kind of learning, for all kinds of people, wherever they are in the world. We''ve been involved in education for over 150 years, and by working across 70 countries, in 100 languages, we have built an international reputation for our commitment to high standards and raising achievement through innovation in education. Find out more about how we can help you and your students at: www.pearson.com/uk", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "January 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Publications Code 4CH1_2C_2101_MS", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "All the material in this publication is copyright", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "$ \\textcircled{c} $ Pearson Education Ltd 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "General Marking Guidance", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All candidates must receive the same treatment. Examiners must mark the first candidate in exactly the same way as they mark the last.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Mark schemes should be applied positively. Candidates must be rewarded for what they have shown they can do rather than penalised for omissions.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Examiners should mark according to the mark scheme not according to their perception of where the grade boundaries may lie.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "There is no ceiling on achievement. All marks on the mark scheme should be used appropriately.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All the marks on the mark scheme are designed to be awarded. Examiners should always award full marks if deserved, i.e. if the answer matches the mark scheme. Examiners should also be prepared to award zero marks if the candidate''s response is not worthy of credit according to the mark scheme.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000018", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 18, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Where some judgement is required,mark schemes will provide the principles by which marks will be awarded and exemplification may be limited.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "When examiners are in doubt regarding the application of the mark scheme to a candidate''s response,the team leader must be consulted.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000020", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 20, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Crossed out work should be marked UNLESS the candidate has replaced it with an alternative response.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000021", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 21, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 13:01:26.22694+00');
