e ions are mobileM3 ions/charged particles need to move for current(to flow)/to conduct electricity", "No marks if reference to mobile electrons", "2"], ["(ii)", "calculate the amount, in moles, of NaCl determine the amount, in moles, of Cl2calculate the volume of Cl2give the final answer in standard formExample calculationM1 234000058.5M2 4000002OR 200000M3 200000x24OR 480000(dm3)M4 4.8x106(dm3)", "OR answer to M12OR answer to M2x24OR answer to M3 in standard formcorrect answer in standard form without working scores4480000 without working scores39.6x106and1.92x107score3960000and1920000score2M4 can be awarded for an answer in standard form as long as some working is shown", "4"], ["", "", "", "Total 13"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n6(c)(i) | An explanation that links two of the following pointsM1 in solid sodium chloride the ions are not free to move/are in fixed positionsM2 in molten sodium chloride the ions are mobileM3 ions/charged particles need to move for current(to flow)/to conduct electricity | No marks if reference to mobile electrons | 2\n(ii) | calculate the amount, in moles, of NaCl determine the amount, in moles, of Cl2calculate the volume of Cl2give the final answer in standard formExample calculationM1 234000058.5M2 4000002OR 200000M3 200000x24OR 480000(dm3)M4 4.8x106(dm3) | OR answer to M12OR answer to M2x24OR answer to M3 in standard formcorrect answer in standard form without working scores4480000 without working scores39.6x106and1.92x107score3960000and1920000score2M4 can be awarded for an answer in standard form as long as some working is shown | 4\n |  |  | Total 13", "row_count": 4, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000030", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 30, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["7(a)", "M1Xconical flask", "", "3"], ["M2Ypipette", "", ""], ["M3Zburette", "", ""], ["(b)", "B colourlessA is not correct as the colour of phenolphthalein in phosphoric acid is not blueC is not correct as phenolphthalein is pink in alkali not in acidD is not correct as the colour of phenolphthalein in phosphoric acid is not red", "", "1"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n7(a) | M1Xconical flask |  | 3\nM2Ypipette |  | \nM3Zburette |  | \n(b) | B colourlessA is not correct as the colour of phenolphthalein in phosphoric acid is not blueC is not correct as phenolphthalein is pink in alkali not in acidD is not correct as the colour of phenolphthalein in phosphoric acid is not red |  | 1", "row_count": 5, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000031", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 31, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["7(c)(i)(ii)", "(ii)", "ticks in boxes 1,2 and 4", "", "1"], ["M1 30.35+30.25+30.30/3", "", ""], ["M2 30.30", "30.30 without working scores 2", ""], ["30.3 without working scores 1", ""], ["If no results ticked then only use of 2 or 3 concordant titres can score both marks in(ii)", ""], ["If only one result ticked then M2 can be scored for averaging two or more titre values correctly", ""], ["M1 CQ on results ticked", ""], ["M2 CQ on correct calculation from M1", "", ""], ["(d)(i)", "(i)", "M1 30.40x0.525/1000", "If no division by 1000 giving an answer of 15.96 award 1 mark", "2"], ["M2 0.01596(mol)", "correct answer without working scores 2", ""], ["(0.01596÷3)=0.00532(mol)", "OR answer to(i)÷3", "1"], ["(iii)", "(iii)", "M1 0.00532x1000/25.0", "OR answer to(ii)x1000/25.0", "2"], ["M2 0.2128(mol/dm3)", "OR answer toM1 evaluated correctly correct answer without working scores 2", ""], ["", "ACCEPT answers to any number of sig figs except1 throughout(d)", ""], ["If no division by 1000 in(i) and no multiplication by 1000 in(iii) do not penalise twice", "", "Total 12"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n7(c)(i)(ii) | (ii) | ticks in boxes 1,2 and 4 |  | 1\nM1 30.35+30.25+30.30/3 |  | \nM2 30.30 | 30.30 without working scores 2 | \n30.3 without working scores 1 | \nIf no results ticked then only use of 2 or 3 concordant titres can score both marks in(ii) | \nIf only one result ticked then M2 can be scored for averaging two or more titre values correctly | \nM1 CQ on results ticked | \nM2 CQ on correct calculation from M1 |  | \n(d)(i) | (i) | M1 30.40x0.525/1000 | If no division by 1000 giving an answer of 15.96 award 1 mark | 2\nM2 0.01596(mol) | correct answer without working scores 2 | \n(0.01596÷3)=0.00532(mol) | OR answer to(i)÷3 | 1\n(iii) | (iii) | M1 0.00532x1000/25.0 | OR answer to(ii)x1000/25.0 | 2\nM2 0.2128(mol/dm3) | OR answer toM1 evaluated correctly correct answer without working scores 2 | \n | ACCEPT answers to any number of sig figs except1 throughout(d) | \nIf no division by 1000 in(i) and no multiplication by 1000 in(iii) do not penalise twice |  | Total 12", "row_count": 16, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000032", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 32, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000006"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "sectionId": "s002", "elementIds": ["e000008", "e000009", "e000010", "e000011", "e000012", "e000013", "e000014", "e000015", "e000016", "e000017", "e000018", "e000019", "e000020", "e000021"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "52710504-b7a4-52bb-ae2a-ccf96bcf022f", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T13:02:32.256846306Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 60, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 0, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "PMT", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel International GCSE In Chemistry (4CH1) Paper 2C", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC qualifications are awarded by Pearson, the UK''s largest awarding body. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers. For further information visit our qualifications websites at www.edexcel.com or www.btec.co.uk. Alternatively, you can get in touch with us using the details on our contact us page at www.edexcel.com/contactus.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson aspires to be the world''s leading learning company. Our aim is to help everyone progress in their lives through education. We believe in every kind of learning, for all kinds of people, wherever they are in the world. We''ve been involved in education for over 150 years, and by working across 70 countries, in 100 languages, we have built an international reputation for our commitment to high standards and raising achievement through innovation in education. Find out more about how we can help you and your students at: www.pearson.com/uk", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Question Paper Log Number 66057", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Publications Code 4CH1_2C_2106_MS", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "All the material in this publication is copyright", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "$ \\textcircled{c} $ Pearson Education Ltd 2021", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All candidates must receive the same treatment. Examiners must mark the first candidate in exactly the same way as they mark the last.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Mark schemes should be applied positively. Candidates must be rewarded for what they have shown they can do rather than penalised for omissions.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "There is no ceiling on achievement. All marks on the mark scheme should be used appropriately.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Examiners should mark according to the mark scheme not according to their perception of where the grade boundaries may lie.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All the marks on the mark scheme are designed to be awarded. Examiners should always award full marks if deserved, i.e. if the answer matches the mark scheme. Examiners should also be prepared to award zero marks if the candidate''s response is not worthy of credit according to the mark scheme.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000018", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 18, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Where some judgement is required,mark schemes will provide the principles by which marks will be awarded and exemplification may be limited.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "When examiners are in doubt regarding the application of the mark scheme to a candidate''s response, the team leader must be consulted.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000020", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 20, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Crossed out work should be marked UNLESS the candidate has replaced it with an alternative response.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000021", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 21, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 13:02:53.366201+00');
