 | ALLOW boiled\nIGNORE\nvapourised/evaporated | 3\nM2 fractionating | ACCEPT fractional distillation | \nM3 boiling point(s) | ACCEPT boiling temperature(s)\nIGNORE melting point(s)/low density | \n(b) road surfacing/roofing | ALLOW roads | 1\n(c)(i) | pentane |  | 1\n(Mr=5x12+12x1=)72 |  | 1\n(ii) |  |  | ", "row_count": 8, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000024", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 24, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["2(d)", "M1alumina/silica", "ACCEPTaluminiumoxide/silicon dioxide/Al2O3/SiO2/zeolite(s)/aluminosilicate(s)", "2"], ["M2any temperature in the range600-700℃inclusive", "", ""], ["(e)", "(C10H22→C4H10)+C2H4+C4H8", "alkenes can be in eitherorder", "2"], ["M1C2H4", "", ""], ["M2C4H8", "ALLOW1mark forC6H12/2C3H6/C3H6+C3H6", ""], ["", "ALLOWcorrectdisplayedformulae", ""], ["", "", "", "Total10"]], "text": "Question number | Answer | Notes | Marks\n2(d) | M1alumina/silica | ACCEPTaluminiumoxide/silicon dioxide/Al2O3/SiO2/zeolite(s)/aluminosilicate(s) | 2\nM2any temperature in the range600-700℃inclusive |  | \n(e) | (C10H22→C4H10)+C2H4+C4H8 | alkenes can be in eitherorder | 2\nM1C2H4 |  | \nM2C4H8 | ALLOW1mark forC6H12/2C3H6/C3H6+C3H6 | \n | ALLOWcorrectdisplayedformulae | \n |  |  | Total10", "row_count": 8, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000025", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 25, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["Question number", "Answer", "Notes", "Marks"], ["3(a)", "A description that includes six of the following points", "", "6"], ["M1use the pipette to add(25cm3of) potassium hydroxide(solution)to the(conical)flask", "", ""], ["M2add a few drops of methyl orange(to the flask)", "", ""], ["M3add sulfuric acid to the burette and record the initial b