verse reaction equally | ALLOW has the same effect on the rate of forward and reverse reaction | 1\n(iii) | M1 yield increases\nM2 the (forward) reaction is exothermic | ALLOW the reverse reaction is endothermic\nIGNORE any references to Le Chatelier''s Principle (moves/shifts)\nM2 dep on M1 correct or missing | 2\n(iv) | M1 yield increases\nM2 there are more moles of (gaseous) reactants than products/there are fewer (gaseous) moles on the right hand side/there are 3 moles (of gas) on the left and 1 mole (of gas) on the right ORA | IGNORE any references to Le Chatelier''s Principle (moves/shifts)\nM2 dep on M1 correct or missing | 2", "row_count": 6, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000029", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 29, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["(b)(i)", "M1(bonds broken)=436+436+1072OR1944M2(bonds formed)=414+414+414+358+463OR2063M31944-2063(=-119)", "", "3"], ["(ii)", "an explanation that links together the following two points:M1more energy is given out when the bonds are madeM2than is taken in when the bonds are broken ORORM1breaking bonds is endothermic/takes in energy AND making bonds is exothermic/releases energyM2the energy released is more than the energy taken in", "IGNORE refs to numbers of bondsDEP on M1If state / imply that energy required to make bonds ORIf state / imply that energy released when bonds are broken scores 0", "2"], ["(c)(i)", "Chemical structure of a molecule with a double bond", "", "1"], ["(ii)", "Chemical structure of a molecule with a triple bond", "REJECT -OH not displayed", "1"], ["", "", "", "Total 14"]], "text": "(b)(i) | M1(bonds broken)=436+436+1072OR1944M2(bonds formed)=414+414+414+358+463OR2063M31944-2063(=-119) |  | 3\n(ii) | an explanation that links together the following two points:M1more energy is given out when the bonds are madeM2than is taken in when the bonds are broken ORORM1breaking bonds is endothermic/takes in energy AND making bonds is exothermic/releases energyM2the energy released is more than the energy taken in | IGNORE refs to numbers of bondsDEP on M1If state / imply that energy required to make bonds ORIf state / imply that energy released when bonds are broken scores 0 | 2\n(c)(i) | Chemical structure of a molecule with a double bond |  | 1\n(ii) | Chemical structure of a molecule with a triple bond | REJECT -OH not displayed | 1\n |  |  | Total 14", "row_count": 5, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000030", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 4, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 30, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "figures": [], "version": 1, "sections": [{"level": 2, "title": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "sectionId": "s001", "elementIds": ["e000005"], "pageNumber": 1}, {"level": 2, "title": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "sectionId": "s002", "elementIds": ["e000007", "e000008", "e000009", "e000010", "e000011", "e000012", "e000013", "e000014", "e000015", "e000016", "e000017", "e000018", "e000019", "e000020"], "pageNumber": 1}], "equations": [], "pageCount": 1, "documentId": "0647b12b-43e7-5728-8be9-61999a85d2fb", "provenance": {"engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "application": "syllabai-parser", "extractedAt": "2026-09-13T13:03:19.694640534Z", "engineVersion": "1.1.0", "schemaVersion": "1.0", "extractionParams": {"pageBoundaries": "none-in-source", "sourceLineCount": 47, "upstreamConverter": "zai-glm-ocr", "entityDecodedLines": 3, "signedUrlFigureRefs": 0, "normalizedHtmlEntities": true}}, "textBlocks": [{"role": "paragraph", "text": "PMT", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Mark Scheme (Results)", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000001", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 1, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2023", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000002", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 2, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson Edexcel International GCSE In Chemistry (4CH1) Paper 2CR", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000003", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 3, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC Qualifications", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000004", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 4, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Edexcel and BTEC qualifications are awarded by Pearson, the UK''s largest awarding body. We provide a wide range of qualifications including academic, vocational, occupational and specific programmes for employers. For further information visit our qualifications websites at www.edexcel.com or www.btec.co.uk. Alternatively, you can get in touch with us using the details on our contact us page at www.edexcel.com/contactus.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000005", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 5, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "heading", "text": "Pearson: helping people progress, everywhere", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000006", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": 2, "reading_order": 6, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Pearson aspires to be the world''s leading learning company. Our aim is to help everyone progress in their lives through education. We believe in every kind of learning, for all kinds of people, wherever they are in the world. We''ve been involved in education for over 150 years, and by working across 70 countries, in 100 languages, we have built an international reputation for our commitment to high standards and raising achievement through innovation in education. Find out more about how we can help you and your students at: www.pearson.com/uk", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000007", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 7, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Summer 2023", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000008", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 8, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Question Paper Log Number P71953A", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000009", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 9, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "Publications Code 4CH1_2CR_2306_MS", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000010", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 10, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "All the material in this publication is copyright", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000011", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 11, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "paragraph", "text": "$ \\textcircled{c} $ Pearson Education Ltd 2023", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000012", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 12, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All candidates must receive the same treatment. Examiners must mark the first candidate in exactly the same way as they mark the last.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000013", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 13, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Mark schemes should be applied positively. Candidates must be rewarded for what they have shown they can do rather than penalised for omissions.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000014", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 14, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Examiners should mark according to the mark scheme not according to their perception of where the grade boundaries may lie.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000015", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 15, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "There is no ceiling on achievement. All marks on the mark scheme should be used appropriately.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000016", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 16, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "All the marks on the mark scheme are designed to be awarded. Examiners should always award full marks if deserved, i.e. if the answer matches the mark scheme. Examiners should also be prepared to award zero marks if the candidate''s response is not worthy of credit according to the mark scheme.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000017", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 17, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Where some judgement is required, mark schemes will provide the principles by which marks will be awarded and exemplification may be limited.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000018", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 18, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "When examiners are in doubt regarding the application of the mark scheme to a candidate''s response, the team leader must be consulted.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000019", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 19, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"role": "list_item", "text": "Crossed out work should be marked UNLESS the candidate has replaced it with an alternative response.", "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000020", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "element_type": "text_block", "heading_level": null, "reading_order": 20, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}], "schemaVersion": "1.0"}', NULL, '2026-09-13 13:03:38.621625+00');
INSERT INTO public.documents VALUES ('00c99592-d3da-4ed7-87d1-73e2574d6226', 'b5287cd4-7ba1-56e4-bddc-fca4d84dea13', '1.0', 1, 'QUESTION_PAPER', 'corpus/igcse-chemistry-4ch0-2c-2024jun/QP.md', 'QP.md', 'text/markdown', '6ca7bd803d701a99c04b3ea45c730025bdc9237b091d4821f82651a775b5f126', 'SHA-256', 1, 120, 117, 8, 'glm-ocr-markdown', '1.1.0', '2026-09-13 13:04:01.505803+00', '{"pages": [{"width": null, "height": null, "pageNumber": 1}], "source": {"uri": "corpus/igcse-chemistry-4ch0-2c-2024jun/QP.md", "checksum": "6ca7bd803d701a99c04b3ea45c730025bdc9237b091d4821f82651a775b5f126", "fileName": "QP.md", "mimeType": "text/markdown", "checksumAlgorithm": "SHA-256"}, "tables": [{"rows": [["Please check the examination details below before entering your candidate information"], ["Candidate surname", "Other names"], ["Centre Number", "Candidate Number"], ["Pearson Edexcel International GCSE (9-1)"], ["Tuesday 11 June 2024"], ["Morning (Time: 1 hour 15 minutes)", "Paper reference 4CH1/2C"], ["Chemistry\nUNIT: 4CH1\nPAPER: 2C"], ["You must have:\nCalculator, ruler"], ["Total Marks"]], "text": "Please check the examination details below before entering your candidate information\nCandidate surname | Other names\nCentre Number | Candidate Number\nPearson Edexcel International GCSE (9-1)\nTuesday 11 June 2024\nMorning (Time: 1 hour 15 minutes) | Paper reference 4CH1/2C\nChemistry\nUNIT: 4CH1\nPAPER: 2C\nYou must have:\nCalculator, ruler\nTotal Marks", "row_count": 9, "confidence": 1.0, "element_id": "e000000", "page_number": 1, "bounding_box": null, "column_count": 1, "element_type": "table", "reading_order": 0, "source_engine": "glm-ocr-markdown", "source_engine_version": "1.1.0"}, {"rows": [["7Li lithium3", "9Be beryllium4", "Key", "4He helium2"], ["23Na sodium11", "24Mg magnesium12", "relative atomic mass atomic symbol atomic (proton) number", "20Ne neon10"], ["39K potassium19", "40Ca calcium20", "45Sc scandium21", "48Ti titanium22", "51V vanadium23", "52Cr chromium24", "55Mn m