Gaseous product
(d) The displayed formula of pentane is
\begin{array}{c c c c c c c} \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} \\ | & | & | & | \\ \mathrm {H} - \mathrm {C} - \mathrm {C} - \mathrm {C} - \mathrm {C} - \mathrm {C} - \mathrm {H} \\ | & | & | & | \\ \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} & \mathrm {H} \\ \end{array}
