\mathrm {F e} _ {2} \left(\mathrm {S O} _ {4}\right) _ {3}
(ii) Write a chemical equation for the reaction of iron(II) sulfate $ \mathrm{(F e S O_{4})} $ with sodium hydroxide solution.
(Total for Question 10 = 8 marks)
