This apparatus can be used to electroplate an iron nail.
(i) Equation 1 shows the reaction at the copper rod.
Equation 1
\mathrm {C u} \rightarrow \mathrm {C u} ^ {2 +} + 2 \mathrm {e} ^ {-}
