B is not correct because the substances found in the Periodic Table (elements) are not arranged in order of increasing mass number
C is not correct because the substances found in the Periodic Table (elements) are not arranged in order of increasing nucleon number
D is not correct because the substances found in the Periodic Table (elements) are not arranged in order of increasing relative atomic mass |  | 1', 1, 1, '["e000024"]', 248, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:53:56.564732+00');
