State what is meant by the term thermal decomposition.
(c) The diagram shows the displayed formula of chloroethene.', 1, 1, '["e000107", "e000108", "e000109", "e000111", "e000113", "e000115", "e000116", "e000117", "e000118", "e000119", "e000120", "e000121", "e000122", "e000123", "e000124", "e000125", "e000126", "e000128", "e000129", "e000130", "e000131", "e000132"]', 290, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:54:39.892201+00');
