look at the cross from above and record the time taken until the cross cannot be seen', 1, 1, '["e000116", "e000117", "e000118", "e000119", "e000120", "e000121", "e000122", "e000125", "e000126", "e000127", "e000128", "e000129"]', 285, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:55:23.194+00');
