(i) Name the black substance that forms on the copper powder.
(ii) Suggest why the teacher uses copper powder instead of the same mass of large pieces of copper.', 1, 1, '["e000100", "e000101", "e000102", "e000103", "e000104", "e000105", "e000106", "e000107", "e000108", "e000110", "e000111", "e000112", "e000113"]', 289, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:56:09.168363+00');
