The percentage yield of tungsten is 73.5%
This is the equation for the reaction.
\mathrm {W O} _ {3} + 3 \mathrm {H} _ {2} \rightarrow \mathrm {W} + 3 \mathrm {H} _ {2} \mathrm {O}
Calculate the mass, in tonnes, of tungsten that is produced when 2784 tonnes of tungsten oxide are reacted with an excess of hydrogen.
