This is the student''s method.
measure the initial length of the column of air in the tube
leave the apparatus for one week
measure the final length of the column of air', 1, 1, '["e000020", "e000021", "e000022", "e000023", "e000024", "e000026", "e000027", "e000028", "e000029", "e000030", "e000031", "e000032", "e000033", "e000035", "e000036", "e000037", "e000038"]', 297, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:56:55.928477+00');
