(ii) Name the process used to coat iron with zinc.', 1, 1, '["e000088", "e000090", "e000091", "e000092", "e000093", "e000094", "e000095", "e000096", "e000097", "e000098", "e000099", "e000100", "e000101", "e000102", "e000103", "e000104", "e000105", "e000106", "e000107", "e000108", "e000109"]', 299, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:56:56.360345+00');
