The letters are not the symbols of the elements.', 1, 1, '["e000019", "e000020", "e000021", "e000022", "e000023", "e000024", "e000025", "e000026", "e000027", "e000028", "e000029", "e000031", "e000032", "e000033"]', 294, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:56:56.520323+00');
