B carbon dioxide gas is dissolved in pure water
C sodium hydroxide solution is neutralised by adding dilute hydrochloric acid
D excess sodium hydroxide solution is added to a weakly acidic solution
E ammonia gas is dissolved in pure water', 1, 1, '["e000020", "e000021", "e000022", "e000023", "e000024", "e000025", "e000026", "e000027", "e000028", "e000029", "e000030", "e000031", "e000032", "e000033", "e000034", "e000035", "e000036", "e000037"]', 275, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:58:26.291183+00');
