B 2.2.6
C 2.8.8
D 2.8.8.2
(d) Neon has two main isotopes that can be represented as $ ^{2 0} \mathrm{N e} $ and $ ^{2 2} \mathrm{N e}. $
(i) Explain, with reference to sub-atomic particles, what is meant by the term isotopes.
