A lead(II) hydroxide
B nitric acid
C sodium hydroxide
D sulfuric acid
(iii) State why the student should not have included steps 4 and 5 in his plan.
(iv) Suggest replacement steps to obtain a pure dry sample of lead(II) sulfate.
step 4
step 5
