B The student used less copper(II) carbonate than in the other experiments.
C The student heated the crucible without a lid on.', 1, 1, '["e000050", "e000051", "e000052", "e000053", "e000054", "e000055", "e000056", "e000057", "e000058", "e000059", "e000060", "e000061", "e000062", "e000063", "e000064", "e000065", "e000066", "e000067", "e000068"]', 285, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 12:59:09.324169+00');
