add 170g of wholemeal flour, 170g of plain flour, 10g of salt and 10.5g of bicarbonate of soda (sodium hydrogencarbonate, $ \mathrm{N a H C O_{3}} $ ）to a bowl and stir
pour in $ 2 9 0 \mathrm{c m}^{3} $ of buttermilk and stir quickly to form a soft dough
form the dough into a round ball and slightly flatten it
cut a cross in the top and bake for 30 minutes in an oven at $ 2 0 0^{\circ} \mathrm{C} $
