\mathrm {N a O H} + \mathrm {H C l} \rightarrow \mathrm {N a C l} + \mathrm {H} _ {2} \mathrm {O}
Calculate the concentration, in mol/dm $ ^{3} $ , of the hydrochloric acid.
\mathrm {m o l / d m ^ {3}}
