(i) Name one other reactant needed for this reaction to occur.', 1, 1, '["e000105", "e000106", "e000107", "e000108", "e000109", "e000110", "e000111", "e000112", "e000113", "e000114", "e000115", "e000116", "e000117"]', 294, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 13:01:26.020089+00');
