A blue
B orange
red C
D yellow
(b) The table shows the student''s results.
titration | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4
volume of acid added in $ \mathrm{c m^{3}} $ | 20.65 | 20.60 | 20.90 | 20.55
concordant results |  |  |  |
