(i) Place ticks ( $ \surd $ ) in the table to show which results are concordant.
(ii) Use the concordant results to calculate the mean (average) volume of acid added.
(c) This table shows the student''s results for another titration.', 1, 1, '["e000115", "e000116", "e000117", "e000118", "e000119", "e000120", "e000121", "e000122", "e000123", "e000124", "e000125", "e000126", "e000127", "e000128", "e000129"]', 253, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 13:01:26.366829+00');
