Give your answer in standard form.
\mathrm {d m} ^ {3}', 1, 1, '["e000127", "e000128", "e000129", "e000130", "e000131", "e000132", "e000133", "e000134", "e000135", "e000136", "e000137", "e000138", "e000139"]', 293, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 13:03:38.466452+00');
