Substance | Melting point/℃ | Boiling point/℃ | Conducts electricity when
solid | liquid
P | 3410 | 5930 | yes | yes
Q | 734 | 1435 | no | yes
R | -95 | 69 | no | no
S | 2507 | 3900 | no | no
Use the information in the table to answer the following questions. You may use each letter once, more than once or not at all.
Choose a substance that:
(a) is a solid at $ 3 0 0 0^{\circ} \mathrm{C} $
A substance P
B substance Q
C substance R
D substance S
(b) is a liquid at $ 2 5^{\circ} \mathrm{C}. $
