xt": "(i)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "bromine/Br/Br2"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Reject bromide/Br-"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(ii)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "reduction and oxidation(at the same time)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Accept oxidisationIgnore oxygenationAccept loss and gain of electron(s)Reject loss of electrons by chlorine(molecules)/gain of electrons by bromide(ions)Reject reduction is loss of electrons/oxidation is gain of electronsIgnore references to other reaction types,eg displacement/reversibleIgnore references to atoms/ions/molecules/elements"}], "answerText": "c", "confidence": 0.75, "markPoints": [], "correctOption": null, "marksCellSource": "label row"}, {"mcq": false, "qwc": false, "label": "5", "marks": 1, "number": 5, "entryId": "ms-4d55c014-q5", "guidance": [{"kind": "note", "text": "(i)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "reversible / can go in both directions / (both) forward and reverse reactions can occur"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Accept just reference to reverse direction, eg reaction goes backwards / reaction goes in opposite direction"}, {"kind": "ignore", "text": "Ignore equilibrium"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(ii)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "shifts to right / moves in forward direction / favours forward reaction/direction"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Accept more PCl5 / product (formed)"}, {"kind": "ignore", "text": "Ignore references to rates"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1 can be awarded in explanation part"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M2"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "fewer moles/molecules (of gas) on right"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "/ more moles/molecules (of gas) on left"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "/ 2 moles/molecules on left and 1 on right"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "/ favours side with fewer moles/molecules"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Accept particles, but not atoms, in place of molecules"},