re", "text": "IGNORE references to adding (dilute)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "HCl/HNO3"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "REJECT add H2SO4"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "2 Grad"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(c)(i)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(graduated) pipette"}, {"kind": "allow", "text": "ALLOW burette"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "1 Cler"}], "answerText": "(a)(i)", "confidence": 0.5, "markPoints": [], "correctOption": null, "marksCellSource": null}, {"mcq": false, "qwc": false, "label": "7(a)", "marks": null, "number": 7, "entryId": "ms-a7488398-q7a", "guidance": [{"kind": "note", "text": "Mark ECF from M1"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "correct answer with no working scores 3"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "1.2 scores 2 marks"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(b)(i)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1 higher yield of CO"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M2 because (equilibrium shifts to the right as the forward) reaction is endothermic"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "ACCEPT more CO is produced"}, {"kind": "ignore", "text": "IGNORE references to Le Chatelier''s Principle eg increasing temperature favours the forward reaction"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M2 DEP M1 correct or missing"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "2"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Exp"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "(ii)"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M1 no effect (on yield) OWTTE"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M2 because equal numbers of moles/molecules (of gas) on both sides"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "M2 DEP M1 correct or missing"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "2"}, {"kind": "note", "text": "Exp"}], "answerText": "calculation with following steps\nM1 calculation of n(K2CO3)\nM2 deduction of n(CO2)和\nvol(CO2) by multiplying by 24(dm3)\nM3 correct evaluation of volume in cm3\nExample calculation\nM1 n(K2CO3)=6.9÷138OR0.05\nM2 vol(CO2)=0.05x24(dm3)\nM3 1200(cm3)", "confidence": 0.5, "markPoints": [], "correctOption": null, "marksCellSource": null}], "icTable": null, "warnings": ["orphan row before first entry: Question number", "orphan row b